WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.909 --> 00:00:05.409
("Jingle Bells" instrumental playing)

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:11.640
- Dear Santa, I would like
a few things for Christmas.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.380
A couple of them are,

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.280
world peace, long hair and
bring the Queen of England

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.510
back to life.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.830
And if you can't do that,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:24.270
I'll take a couple new
books, sparkling water, coal,

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.490
piece of chocolate, and piece of gum

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.980
for my science experiment.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.847
Thank you Santa. Goodbye.

00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:33.046
(audience applauding)
- I like the way

00:00:33.046 --> 00:00:34.950
you think, Juliet.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.980
So all week we feature
letters to Santa from kids

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.080
like Juliet as part of a team effort

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.780
with our season long
partner, Pilot Frixion Pen,

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.270
the go-to erasable pen of
the "Kelly Clarkson Show".

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.060
And the goal is to take
a little pressure off

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.530
Old Saint Nick this year.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.650
Juliet, we want to celebrate
kindhearted, adorable kids

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.920
creating unique and impressive
Christmas lists like you.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.432
So we're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:00:58.432 --> 00:01:01.230
(audience applauding)

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.140
I'm not sure if it can
bring the queen back to life

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.720
or totally trigger world
peace but, well maybe,

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.050
you never know, but you
should be set on books, gum

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.747
and chocolate. Merry Christmas.

00:01:11.747 --> 00:01:13.137
(audience applauding)

00:01:13.137 --> 00:01:14.610
And to everyone watching,

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.040
remember you can pick up
Pilot Frixion Erasable Pens

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:19.203
wherever office supplies are sold.

